// only). Doors elid_underground_lake_door 10423 @ 3354,9558 + _mirror
// 10425 @ 3355,9558 (name Door, op1=Open, N-S corridor). Same dest rule as
// the robe+key pair: coordz(coord) <= coordz(loc_coord) -> north
